message:
The nightly generator ran and every candidate question was rejected — twice in three days. Nothing breaks today: the schedule is filled months ahead and the «schedule ran dry» monitor stays green until then, which is exactly why this one exists. On 2026-09-29..10-02 it failed four nights running and nobody was told.

The log line names the gate that emptied the run: `scripture=… doctrinal=… bilingual=…`. Then read that run's rows in `daily_challenge_question_events` (event_type `scripture_validated` / `doctrinally_reviewed` / `bilingually_reviewed`, details.reason) for the passage named in the line.

